Alembic migrations for ShoppingApp.

Bootstrapped Phase 3 Chunk 3.7a. See CLAUDE.md > Code Architecture & Maintainability >
Migrations for the why and the apply workflow (dev PC: `alembic upgrade head` after pulling a
migration; NUC: run automatically by scripts/update.py).

- The DB URL is NOT in alembic.ini — env.py derives it from app.config.settings.database_path
  so alembic and the app always target the same database.
- `Base.metadata.create_all()` still runs on startup as the fresh-empty-DB fast path; schema
  *changes* go through a migration here. tests/test_migrations.py guards that the two agree.

New migration:  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "short description"
Apply:          alembic upgrade head
